### IntelliJ HTTP client: open this file and click the green arrows (backend must be running).
### 1) Login (Sydney Harbour Private). The token is stored for the following requests.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2) Search patients (paged, sorted)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients?q=john&page=0&size=5&sort=lastName,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Validation error example -> RFC 7807 body with itemised field errors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "", "lastName": "Test", "dob": "2090-01-01", "gender": "FEMALE", "medicareNo": "2123456081" }

### 4) Tenant isolation: a Sydney token cannot read Melbourne data -> 403 TENANT_ACCESS_DENIED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### 5) Admit patient 1 (Emily Johnson, Bupa GOLD) with doctor 1 into bed 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": 1, "doctorId": 1, "admissionTypeId": 2, "financialClass": "PRIVATE", "careSetting": "IPD", "diagnosis": "Chest pain", "roomId": 1 }

> {% client.global.set("admissionId", response.body.admission.id); %}

### 6) Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) Self-registration (public): creates a BILLING_OFFICER for Sydney and returns a JWT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{ "hospitalId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "fullName": "Olivia Bennett", "username": "olivia.bennett",
  "email": "olivia.bennett@harbour.example.au", "password": "Olivia@2026", "confirmPassword": "Olivia@2026",
  "role": "BILLING_OFFICER" }

### 8) Weekly roster of doctor 3 (Dr Priya Sharma)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/3/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) Record a specialist consultation on the admission (billed with MBS item 116)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admissions/{{admissionId}}/consultations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "doctorId": 3, "consultationType": "SPECIALIST_REVIEW", "notes": "Reviewed ECG and troponin" }

### 10) Discharge: bed -> AVAILABLE, bill generated and lines locked
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admissions/{{admissionId}}/discharge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11) The bill created at discharge
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admissions/{{admissionId}}/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("billId", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### 12) Tax invoice / discharge summary data (what the PDF prints)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bills/{{billId}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
